{"rows":[[[],"order",null,"::X",{}],[["order"],"reference",null,"Order SO-1042 · Workshop lighting",{}],[["order"],"revision",null,1,{}],[["order"],"ui",null,"::X",{}],[["order","ui"],"closed",null,false,{}],[["order","ui"],"checked",null,false,{}],[["order"],"customer",null,"::X",{}],[["order","customer"],"name",null,"North Workshop Ltd",{}],[["order","customer"],"contact",null,"Alex Morgan",{}],[["order","customer"],"email",null,"orders@example.com",{}],[["order","customer"],"phone",null,"+44 20 7946 0420",{}],[["order","customer"],"ui",null,"::X",{}],[["order","customer","ui"],"closed",null,false,{}],[["order","customer","ui"],"checked",null,false,{}],[["order","customer"],"guide",null,"### Who should receive order updates?\n\nUse the **customer name** for the organisation placing the order. The delivery recipient may be different.\n\n1. Enter a named **contact person** who can approve changes.\n2. Use an **email** monitored by the purchasing team.\n3. Enter a **phone number** with its country prefix, so the carrier can call from another region.\n\n### Before marking Reviewed\n\nRead the name, email and phone back to your contact. A review mark is a local checklist; it does not send a message or save the order.\n\nYou can fold the card after reviewing it and still reopen this guide from its header.",{}],[["order"],"billing",null,"::X",{}],[["order","billing"],"title",null,"Invoice address",{}],[["order","billing"],"recipient",null,"North Workshop · Accounts",{}],[["order","billing"],"street",null,"18 King Street",{}],[["order","billing"],"city",null,"London",{}],[["order","billing"],"zip",null,"WC2E 8JT",{}],[["order","billing"],"country",null,"United Kingdom",{}],[["order","billing"],"reference",null,"PO-4821 · Accounts department",{}],[["order","billing"],"ui",null,"::X",{}],[["order","billing","ui"],"closed",null,false,{}],[["order","billing","ui"],"checked",null,false,{}],[["order"],"shipping",null,"::X",{}],[["order","shipping"],"title",null,"Delivery plan",{}],[["order","shipping"],"window",null,"Tuesday, 09:00–12:00",{}],[["order","shipping"],"instructions",null,"Use gate B. Call Alex before unloading.",{}],[["order","shipping"],"ui",null,"::X",{}],[["order","shipping","ui"],"closed",null,false,{}],[["order","shipping","ui"],"checked",null,false,{}],[["order","shipping"],"address",null,"::X",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"title",null,"Workshop address",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"recipient",null,"North Workshop · Goods in",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"street",null,"42 River Road",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"city",null,"Bristol",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"zip",null,"BS1 4QA",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"country",null,"United Kingdom",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"reference",null,"Gate B · Facilities team",{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"ui",null,"::X",{}],[["order","shipping","address","ui"],"closed",null,false,{}],[["order","shipping","address","ui"],"checked",null,false,{}],[["order","shipping","address"],"guide",null,"### Describe the entrance the driver should use\n\n- **Recipient:** the receiving team or named person, not necessarily the billing customer.\n- **Street and number:** the actual delivery entrance. Include a unit number when needed.\n- **City, postal code and country:** complete all three so the carrier can distinguish similar addresses.\n- **Access reference:** a gate, reception desk or loading-bay reference that will still make sense on delivery day.\n\n### Example\n\nFor a workshop with a separate goods entrance, use `Gate B · Goods in` as the access reference and put unloading restrictions in the Delivery plan card.\n\nChanging the delivery address does not change the invoice address. Folding this card retains your draft.",{}],[["order"],"showGuide",null,true,{}]]}::X